pe/math "− 7"] "category" "local_authored" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-319112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "For the matrix\n$C=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 6\\end{aligned}].$\nfind the minor ${M}_{12}$ of the entry ${c}_{12}.$\n\n${M}_{12}=${{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The minor of ${c}_{12}=2$ (first row, second column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $2$ are removed: \n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 2 & ∗ \\\\ 0 & ∗ & 4 \\\\ 7 & ∗ & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${c}_{12}=2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{12} & =\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0\\cdot 6-4\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =0-28 \\\\  & =-28.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-28"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "For the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}x & 3 & y \\\\ 2 & x & z \\\\ 1 & w & 5\\end{aligned}],$\nfind the minor ${M}_{12}$ of the element ${a}_{12}.$\n\n${M}_{12}=${{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To evaluate the minor of ${a}_{12},$ we remove the first row and second column: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 3 & ∗ \\\\ 2 & ∗ & z \\\\ 1 & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${a}_{12}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{12} & =det[\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 5-z\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =10-z\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${m}_{31}$ in the matrix\n$M=[\\begin{aligned}-50 & g & f \\\\ f & {g}^{2} & {f}^{2} \\\\ 20g & g & -5\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the third row and first column:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & g & f \\\\ ∗ & {g}^{2} & {f}^{2} \\\\ 20g & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}g & f \\\\ {g}^{2} & {f}^{2}\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}g & f \\\\ {g}^{2} & {f}^{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =g\\cdot {f}^{2}-f\\cdot {g}^{2} \\\\  & =g{f}^{2}-f{g}^{2} \\\\  & =gf(f-g)\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/state.json" "file_sha256" "2031ff9c967ebaa718901c3c8a2f5a34ac71ec77963bc7d5c374ac1c90a4261e" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "10f9a01882929c805ae8f03f880f100764bc453c1ee7d0fe363e3949f3e61664" "basis" 761 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13973600/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "