{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0\\cdot 6-4\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =0-28 \\\\  & =-28.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319112" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-28"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "For the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}x & 3 & y \\\\ 2 & x & z \\\\ 1 & w & 5\\end{aligned}],$\nfind the minor ${M}_{12}$ of the element ${a}_{12}.$\n\n${M}_{12}=${{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To evaluate the minor of ${a}_{12},$ we remove the first row and second column: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 3 & ∗ \\\\ 2 & ∗ & z \\\\ 1 & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${a}_{12}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{12} & =det[\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 5-z\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =10-z\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-275501" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "10-z"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${e}_{13}$ in the matrix\n$E=[\\begin{aligned}x & 2 & y \\\\ w-1 & 1-w & 3 \\\\ 1-w & w-1 & -10y\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the first row and the third column:\n\n$$\nE=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & y \\\\ w-1 & 1-w & ∗ \\\\ 1-w & w-1 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}w-1 & 1-w \\\\ 1-w & w-1\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}w-1 & 1-w \\\\ 1-w & w-1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(w-1)\\cdot (w-1)-(1-w)\\cdot (1-w) \\\\  & =(w-1)^{2}-(1-w)^{2} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "2{w}^{2}-4w+2"] ["math" "x{w}^{2}-10"] ["math" "yw+2"] ["math" "{w}^{2}-4y"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128021" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${x}_{12}$ in the matrix\n$X=[\\begin{aligned}6a & -3a & c \\\\ -b & {b}^{2} & -2c \\\\ -a & 0 & b\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the first row and second column:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & -3a & ∗ \\\\ -b & ∗ & -2c \\\\ -a & ∗ & b\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}-b & -2c \\\\ -a & b\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}-b & -2c \\\\ -a & b\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-b\\cdot b-(-2c)\\cdot (-a) \\\\  & =-{b}^{2}-2ac\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3ab"] ["math" "-{b}^{2}-2ac"] ["math" "2ac-{b}^{2}"] ["math" "6ac-{b}^{c}2"] ["math" "{b}^{2}+2ac"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-1098" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-{b}^{2}-2ac"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${t}_{22}$ in the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}3p & r & 3p \\\\ q & r & -q \\\\ -6q & -p & 6q\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the second row and the second column:\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}3p & ∗ & 3p \\\\ ∗ & r & ∗ \\\\ -6q & ∗ & 6q\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}3p & 3p \\\\ -6q & 6q\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3p & 3p \\\\ -6q & 6q\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3p\\cdot 6q-3p\\cdot (-6q) \\\\  & =18pq+18pq \\\\  & =36pq\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "0"] ["math" "36pq"] ["math" "3pr-{r}^{2}"] ["math" "5pq+6r"] ["math" "6qr-p"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "36pq"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the minor of ${m}_{31}$ in the matrix\n$M=[\\begin{aligned}-50 & g & f \\\\ f & {g}^{2} & {f}^{2} \\\\ 20g & g & -5\\end{aligned}]?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the third row and first column:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & g & f \\\\ ∗ & {g}^{2} & {f}^{2} \\\\ 20g & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}g & f \\\\ {g}^{2} & {f}^{2}\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}g & f \\\\ {g}^{2} & {f}^{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =g\\cdot {f}^{2}-f\\cdot {g}^{2} \\\\  & =g{f}^{2}-f{g}^{2} \\\\  & =gf(f-g)\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "gf(f+g)"] ["math" "gf(f-g)"] ["math" "gf+5f"] ["math" "gf-3g"] ["math" "{f}^{2}+{g}^{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-128030" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "gf(f-g)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319139" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & r & 3 \\\\ 4 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nGiven that the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is $15$, find the value of $r$ in the matrix above.\n\n$r=$\n {{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319139" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To evaluate the minor of ${b}_{23},$ we remove the second row and third column: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & r & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 6 \\\\ 7 & 8 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}1 & r \\\\ 7 & 8\\end{aligned}] & =1\\cdot 8-r\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =8-7r.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${b}_{23}$ is $15$, so we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8-7r & =15 \\\\ -7r & =7 \\\\ r & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $r=-1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319139" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a4dd318212df18d98a355bb767d83eb1fe8560ad809fa5462916bbfb0972d207"} {"question" "q-319139" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-319139" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-18247" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that the minor of ${a}_{32}$ is $-50$, find all the possible values of $x$ in the matrix\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 3 & 4 \\\\ x & 1 & 3x \\\\ -12 & -4 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-18247" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we remove the third row and second column:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-7 & ∗ & 4 \\\\ x & ∗ & 3x \\\\ ∗ & -4 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of ${a}_{32}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 \\\\ x & 3x\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 \\\\ x & 3x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-7)\\cdot 3x-x\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-21x-4x \\\\  & =-25x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${a}_{32}$ is $-50$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-25x & =-50 \\\\ x & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/state.json" "file_sha256" "38bb04d000f05b25d1e93fe0abbc555eb6432cef80f38cea471d9e2d0a1e26cc"} {"question" "q-18247" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037782/activity-metadata.json" 